You bared your teeth and loudly roared, pretending that you were about to attack the mugger. It was enough. He threw the knife and even the bag and ran down the street. Soon he disappeared from your sight. 
You came closer to the bag and caught the scent of groceries.  Bread, cheese, some vegetables... raw meat!
Only now you realized how hungry you were. You shook out the contents of the bag and greedily dug in the meat like a wild beast. Actually, you were a wild beast!